OL,3,GNEWSAInadequate maternity services
OL,4,Aupgraded to 'good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaternity services at York and
OL,7,FScarborough hospitals have been
OL,8,Fupgraded from inadequate to good,
OL,9,Ffollowing an inspection by the Care
OL,10,FQuality Commission (CQC).
OL,12,FThe watchdog said "significant
OL,13,Fimprovements" had been seen across both
OL,14,Fmaternity units, which had been
OL,15,Fcriticised in 2023 over issues around
OL,16,Fsafety measures and staff training.
OL,18,FAccording to the latest report, staff
OL,19,Fwere called "real life angels" by women
OL,20,Fin their care and improvements had been
OL,21,Fmade to staffing, baby tagging and
OL,22,Fincident management.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
